⚡️🇹🇷 Millions of users across Türkiye are experiencing internet outages after major ISP TurkNet suffered a nationwide outage, disrupting broadband access for households and businesses across the country.

TurkNet confirmed the outage and said engineers are working to restore service but did not disclose the cause or provide a timeline. Internet monitor NetBlocks also confirmed widespread network disruptions.

